OL,5,G0000 Bugzy Malone's Grandest Game
OL,6,     FThe fallout from the 'Hot Coffee'
OL,7,     Fhidden sex scene causes a major
OL,8,     Fheadache for GTA. Yet Rockstar
OL,9,     Freturn with another masterpiece in
OL,10,     FGTA IV.
OL,11,G0020 Bugzy Malone's Grandest Game
OL,12,     FWhen GTA V arrived, it was a game
OL,13,     Fso big it needed three lead
OL,14,     Fcharacters. They were
OL,15,     Funforgettable performances - and
OL,16,     Fone especially. Meet Trevor.
OL,17,G0040 Bugzy Malone's Grandest Game
OL,18,     FIt's been a decade - but finally
OL,19,     Fthe announcement that set the
OL,20,     Fgaming world on fire. GTA VI is
OL,21,     Fcoming. The biggest question -
OL,22,     Fwhat will it be?
